    "created_at": "2023-02-18T05:20:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-18T05:20:08Z",
    "body": "I don't think streams, which are a basic data structure-ish primitive, should have hooks into environment-specific termination signals like this.\r\n\r\nIf specific streams, e.g. response body streams, want to add such hooks, that's reasonable. (But, their spec should be updated to include that.)",
