    "updated_at": "2023-02-18T06:29:11Z",
    "body": "While that sounds reasonable, wouldn't it be a footgun for other Stream-using specs when the core Streams spec doesn't cover it? File System and WebTransport may also need to deal with this themselves for example.\r\n\r\n(Depends on whether we should do this at all, though.)",
